sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant CLI as CompatBSD CLI
    participant App as Application manifest
    participant Runtime as Runtime plugin
    participant Backend as Execution backend
    participant Mounts as Mount manager
    participant Bridges as Host bridges
    participant Rootfs as Linux rootfs
    participant Loader as ELF loader
    participant Linuxulator as Linuxulator
    participant Kernel as FreeBSD kernel

    User->>CLI: compatbsd app run <application>
    CLI->>App: Load application requirements
    App-->>CLI: Runtime, executable and bridge requirements

    CLI->>Runtime: Validate selected runtime
    Runtime->>Rootfs: Check release, loader and libc
    Rootfs-->>Runtime: Verification result
    Runtime-->>CLI: Runtime ready

    CLI->>Backend: Prepare execution
    Backend->>Mounts: Prepare controlled mounts
    Mounts-->>Backend: Owned mount records

    Backend->>Bridges: Prepare required host integrations
    Bridges-->>Backend: Environment and resource access

    Backend->>Rootfs: Execute as the requesting user
    Rootfs->>Loader: Load application ELF
    Loader->>Rootfs: Resolve libraries and symbol versions
    Loader->>Linuxulator: Start Linux process

    loop Application execution
        Linuxulator->>Kernel: Handle Linux ABI system call
        Kernel-->>Linuxulator: Kernel result
    end

    Rootfs-->>Backend: Exit status, stdout and stderr
    Backend->>Bridges: Clean up owned bridge resources
    Backend->>Mounts: Clean up owned mounts
    Backend-->>CLI: Execution result
    CLI-->>User: Status and diagnostics
